{
  "uid": "mtogo-backend-requests",
  "title": "MTOGO — backend API requests",
  "description": "Slices #169/#170/#194: completed ordinary API responses from one HTTP-serving Medusa process, by matched route pattern or fixed fallback. No business counts.",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 3,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": ["mtogo", "ordinary-api"],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Request coverage",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**One HTTP-serving backend process**, target `backend-metrics:9464`: the local demo, or the staging `backend` container with browser and server-side calls from the storefront and partner app (a split staging worker serves no HTTP). Every completed ordinary API response, by matched route pattern. Method-less middleware finishing before any route matches gives fixed categories: refusals (publishable key, namespace or method-less authentication, malformed body) as `early_rejection`, 404s as `unmatched`, successes such as CORS preflights as `unrouted`; unknown methods as `OTHER`. A wildcard middleware refusal shows its wildcard. IDs/query strings never become labels. Health, `/app` Admin assets, `/static`, scrapes and established SSE streams are excluded."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Interpret the observations",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**HTTP responses, not Customers or Orders.** Raw counts reset on restart. Five-minute counts are estimates requiring two scrapes; a new status may miss its first response. DOWN/missing history is unavailable. Latency, runtime, SSE, interruptions and warning controls are deferred."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Exporter scrape availability (not API readiness)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mtogo-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "1 = scrape succeeded; 0 = scrape failed; no data = no target observations. Does not prove database or API readiness.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Unavailable",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN — scrape failed",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP — scrape succeeded",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=\"mtogo-backend\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Estimated completed responses — rolling 5 minutes",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 9,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mtogo-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Extrapolated estimate, not an exact ledger. Per-series increase handles counter resets. Requires sufficient history and a currently successful scrape.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#B8BEC9"
          },
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "noValue": "Unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(mtogo_http_requests_total{job=\"mtogo-backend\"}[5m]) and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"mtogo-backend\"} == 1))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Observed completed responses since process start",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 15,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 9,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mtogo-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Raw process counter. Useful for the first read: 0 → 1 after the next scrape. Resets on backend restart. Unavailable while target is DOWN.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#B8BEC9"
          },
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "noValue": "Unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(mtogo_http_requests_total{job=\"mtogo-backend\"} and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"mtogo-backend\"} == 1))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Completed responses by final status — since process start",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mtogo-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Final server-side status after response completion, counted once. Newly observed status series begin at their actual counter value. Gaps are not joined.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "noValue": "Unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (method, route, status) (mtogo_http_requests_total{job=\"mtogo-backend\"} and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"mtogo-backend\"} == 1))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{route}} — HTTP {{status}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Completed response rate — rolling 5 minutes (responses/second)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mtogo-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Per-series rate before aggregation; counter resets do not produce negative traffic. Status series need two observations. Gaps remain visible.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "noValue": "Unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(mtogo_http_requests_total{job=\"mtogo-backend\"}[5m]) and on(job, instance) (up{job=\"mtogo-backend\"} == 1))",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP {{status}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
